          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The elder unto Gaius the beloved, whom I love in truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beloved, I pray that in all things thou mayest prosper and be in health, even as thy soul prospereth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I rejoiced greatly, when brethren came and bare witness unto thy truth, even as thou walkest in truth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Greater joy have I none than this, to hear of my children walking in the truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beloved, thou doest a faithful work in whatsoever thou doest toward them that are brethren and strangers withal; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who bare witness to thy love before the church: whom thou wilt do well to set forward on their journey worthily of God: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because that for the sake of the Name they went forth, taking nothing of the Gentiles. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We therefore ought to welcome such, that we may be fellow-workers for the truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I wrote somewhat unto the church: but Diotrephes, who loveth to have the preeminence among them, receiveth us not. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore, if I come, I will bring to remembrance his works which he doeth, prating against us with wicked words: and not content therewith, neither doth he himself receive the brethren, and them that would he forbiddeth and casteth ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " out of the church. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beloved, imitate not that which is evil, but that which is good. He that doeth good is of God: he that doeth evil hath not seen God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Demetrius hath the witness of all ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and of the truth itself: yea, we also bear witness; and thou knowest that our witness is true.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I had many things to write unto thee, but I am unwilling to write ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to thee with ink and pen: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but I hope shortly to see thee, and we shall speak face to face. Peace ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " unto thee. The friends salute thee. Salute the friends by name.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
